	␀␀␀␀Ä⁄Returns SupportClass.GetTickCount(). Should be replaced by a StopWatch or the per peer PhotonPeer.ClientTime.
	␀␀␀␀\The static string Version should be preferred.
	␀␀␀␀Ä¯The PhotonPeer will no longer use this delegate. It uses a Stopwatch in all cases. You can access PhotonPeer.ConnectionTime.
